{"id": "90000030", "name": "חזקה של מטריצה 2×2 בעזרת משפט קיילי–המילטון – Aᵏ=αA+βI", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "seqab", "params": ["t", "dd", "k"], "body": "block([al:[1],be:[0]],for n:2 thru k do (al:endcons(t*last(al)+last(be),al), be:endcons(-dd*al[n-1],be)),[al,be])"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונה המטריצה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ A={{CT:0}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>קיימים מספרים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\)</span> כך ש-</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ A^{ {{CT:1}} }=\\alpha A+\\beta I \\]</p><p>כאן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(I\\)</span> היא מטריצת היחידה מסדר 2. היעזרו במשפט קיילי–המילטון כדי למצוא את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> ואת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\beta\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\alpha=\\) [[input:ans1]]&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\(\\beta=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> לפי משפט קיילי–המילטון <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A^2\\)</span> הוא צירוף לינארי של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(I\\)</span>. מזה מקבלים נוסחת נסיגה למקדמים של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A^n\\)</span>, ומחשבים אותם עד <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n={{CT:1}}\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הפולינום האופייני</b><br>עבור מטריצה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(2\\times 2\\)</span> הפולינום האופייני הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(p(\\lambda)=\\lambda^2-(\\operatorname{tr}A)\\lambda+\\det A\\)</span>. כאן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\operatorname{tr}A={{CT:2}}\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\det A={{CT:3}}\\)</span>, ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ p(\\lambda)={{CT:4}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — משפט קיילי–המילטון</b><br>כל מטריצה מאפסת את הפולינום האופייני שלה: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(p(A)=0\\)</span>, כלומר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A^2-(\\operatorname{tr}A)A+(\\det A)I=0\\)</span>. מכאן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ A^2={{CT:5}} \\]</p>כך אפשר להחליף כל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A^2\\)</span> בצירוף של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(I\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — נוסחת נסיגה</b><br>נניח <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A^n=\\alpha_n A+\\beta_n I\\)</span>. כופלים ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span> ומציבים את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A^2\\)</span> מהשלב הקודם:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ A^{n+1}=\\alpha_n A^2+\\beta_n A=\\alpha_n\\left({{CT:5}}\\right)+\\beta_n A=\\left({{CT:6}}\\right)A+\\left({{CT:7}}\\right)I \\]</p>כלומר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\alpha_{n+1}={{CT:6}}\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\beta_{n+1}={{CT:7}}\\)</span>, מתחילים מ-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A^1=1\\cdot A+0\\cdot I\\)</span>:<table dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:8px auto;border-collapse:collapse;text-align:center\"><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px\">\\(n\\)</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px\">\\(\\alpha_n\\)</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px\">\\(\\beta_n\\)</th></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px\">\\(1\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px\">\\({{CT:8}}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px\">\\({{CT:9}}\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px\">\\(2\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px\">\\({{CT:10}}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px\">\\({{CT:11}}\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px\">\\(3\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px\">\\({{CT:12}}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px\">\\({{CT:13}}\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px\">\\(4\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px\">\\({{CT:14}}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px\">\\({{CT:15}}\\)</td></tr>[[if test=\"{{CT:24}}\"]]<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px\">\\(5\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px\">\\({{CT:16}}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px\">\\({{CT:17}}\\)</td></tr>[[/if]][[if test=\"{{CT:25}}\"]]<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px\">\\(6\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px\">\\({{CT:18}}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;padding:4px 12px\">\\({{CT:19}}\\)</td></tr>[[/if]]</table></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 4 — התשובה</b><br>מהשורה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n={{CT:1}}\\)</span> בטבלה:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ A^{ {{CT:1}} }={{CT:20}} \\]</p>בדיקה: חישוב ישיר נותן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A^{ {{CT:1}} }={{CT:21}}\\)</span>, וזה בדיוק <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:20}}\\)</span>.<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\alpha={{CT:22}},\\qquad \\beta={{CT:23}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 6, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 6, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "[ans1,ans2]", "tans": "[alpha,beta]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-0-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-0-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "[ans1,ans2]", "tans": "[alw,bew]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">בדקו את הסימן של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\det A\\)</span>: לפי קיילי–המילטון <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A^2=(\\operatorname{tr}A)A-(\\det A)I\\)</span>, עם סימן מינוס לפני <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\det A\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "[ans1,ans2]", "tans": "[alm,bem]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">אלה המקדמים של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A^{ {{CT:26}} }\\)</span>, ולא של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A^{ {{CT:1}} }\\)</span>. בדקו את מספר הצעדים בנסיגה (מתחילים מ-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A^1=A\\)</span>).</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "alpha", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.5, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> נכון, אבל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> שגוי. זכרו ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\beta_{n+1}=-(\\det A)\\,\\alpha_n\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 4, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 4, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "beta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.5, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-4-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> נכון, אבל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> שגוי. זכרו ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\alpha_{n+1}=(\\operatorname{tr}A)\\,\\alpha_n+\\beta_n\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-4-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">היעזרו בפולינום האופייני: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A^2=(\\operatorname{tr}A)A-(\\det A)I\\)</span>. כפלו שוב ושוב ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span> והחליפו בכל פעם את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A^2\\)</span> בביטוי הזה.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["A", "A2", "Ak", "AkS", "ab", "abw", "al", "alP", "alm", "alpha", "alw", "be", "beP", "bem", "beta", "bew", "charp", "dd", "kk", "ok", "recA", "recB", "t"], "nvariants": 50}